WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.528
Describe trade and cooperation with neighbouring countries

00:00:04.367 --> 00:00:09.343
Neighbour: a country sharing a land border with another country. Togo: the country

00:00:09.343 --> 00:00:11.257
along Ghana’s eastern land border.

00:00:12.117 --> 00:00:17.227
Côte d’Ivoire: the country along Ghana’s western land border. Burkina Faso: the

00:00:17.227 --> 00:00:22.338
country along Ghana’s northern land border. Regional trade: buying and selling goods

00:00:22.338 --> 00:00:23.615
across neighbouring countries.

00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:27.842
Label Ghana and its three land neighbours on an outline map.
